Package: LikertEZ
Title: Easy Analysis and Visualization of Likert Scale Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Mohammad", "Mollazehi", email = "mmolazehi@lu.edu.qa", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides functions for summarizing, visualizing, and analyzing 
    Likert-scale survey data. Includes support for computing descriptive statistics, 
    Relative Importance Index (RII), reliability analysis (Cronbach's Alpha), 
    and response distribution plots.
